<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      color: #334155;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ea580c, #f97316);
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 24px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .claim-details {
      background-color: #fff7ed;
      border: 1px solid #ffedd5;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }
    .claim-details h3 {
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #7c2d12;
      font-size: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ffedd5;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .detail-label {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #9a3412;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #431407;
    }
    .amount {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ea580c;
    }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Firm Notice: Outstanding Detention Invoice</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear <%= brokerName || 'Broker / Billing Department' %>,</p>
      
      <p>This is a <strong>Firm Notice</strong> that the detention payment for the load detailed below is now past due. We have previously sent a professional reminder but have not received confirmation or updates regarding payment processing.</p>
      
      <p>Please review the details below and ensure the payment is released immediately to prevent further escalation:</p>
      
      <div class="claim-details">
        <h3>Claim & Detention Details</h3>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Driver Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= driverName %></span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Facility Name:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= facilityName %></span>
        </div>
        <% if (loadNumber) { %>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Load Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= loadNumber %></span>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <% if (bolNumber) { %>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">BOL Number:</span>
          <span class="detail-value"><%= bolNumber %></span>
        </div>
        <% } %>
        <div class="detail-row" style="margin-top: 16px; padding-top: 12px; border-top: 1px dashed #fed7aa;">
          <span class="detail-label" style="font-size: 16px;">Amount Due:</span>
          <span class="amount">$<%= Number(amount).toFixed(2) %></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p>Please reply directly to this email with the payment status, check number, or transaction reference details. If you need any further paperwork, please contact us immediately.</p>
      
      <p>We appreciate your immediate response to settle this matter.</p>
      
      <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Sincerely,<br><strong><%= driverName %></strong></p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Sent automatically via Luke Thompson System on behalf of <%= driverName %>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
